
Welcome

Welcome to our institution. This handbook provides important information regarding academic policies, campus facilities, student services, clubs, events, placements, and code of conduct. Every student is expected to read and follow the guidelines outlined in this handbook.

⸻

Academic Regulations

Attendance Policy

* Students must maintain a minimum of 75% attendance in each subject.
* Students with attendance below 75% may not be permitted to appear for semester examinations.
* Medical leave must be supported with valid documentation.
* Attendance records are updated weekly.

Examination Rules

* Students must carry a valid college ID card for mid examinations and ID card and hall ticket during semester examinations.
* Electronic devices are strictly prohibited inside examination halls.
* Any form of malpractice will result in disciplinary action.
* Students must arrive at least 15 minutes before the scheduled examination time.

Grading System

Grade	Marks Range
O	90–100
A+	80–89
A	70–79
B+	60–69
B	50–59
C	40–49
F	Below 40

